 class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 6pt\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"17\" valign=\"center\" width=\"105\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 6pt\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"17\" valign=\"center\" width=\"103\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 6pt\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"904\" valign=\"center\" width=\"612\" colspan=\"3\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; TEXT-INDENT: -13pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 13pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -13pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 13pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">국민권익위원회</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">에서는 각급 공공기관의 청렴수준을 진단하고 부패취약</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">분</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">야에 대한 자율적인 개선노력을 유도하기 위해 지난 2002년부터 [</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">공공기관</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> 청렴도 조사]를</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> 실시하고 있습니다.</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; TEXT-INDENT: -13pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 13pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -13pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 13pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;본 조사는 귀 기관이 수행하고 있는 업무와 관련하여 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">지난 1년간</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">(2011.7.1 ~ 2012.6.30)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">의</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> 청렴도</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">를 평가하는 조사로서, </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">국민권익위원회의</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> 의뢰를 받은 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">전문조사업체(한국리서치)에서 리</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">서치를 수행합니다.</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; TEXT-INDENT: -13pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 13pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -13pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 13pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">설문조사 기간</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">은 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">8월 말부터 10월 말까지</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">이며 E-mail을 이용한 온라인 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">조</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">사로 진행될 예정입니다. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">전체 직원 중 일부 직원을 무작위로 선정하여 조사가 실시되므로</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> 직원분들의 적극적인 참여</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">를 당부드립니다.</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 70%; TEXT-INDENT: -13pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 13pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 70%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -47.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 47.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 현재 사용하고 계신 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">상용메일</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">(ex: @hanmail.net, @naver.com 등)이나 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">업무용 메일</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">을 수시로 확인하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 50%; TEXT-INDENT: -13pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 13pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 50%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -46.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 46.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ E-mail로 설문지를 받으신 분들은 설문내용을 잘 읽어보시고, 제시</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">하는 보기 중에서 본인의 생각과 가장 가까운 것에 표시하시면 됩니다.</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; TEXT-INDENT: -13pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 13pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -13pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 13pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;평가에 참여하신 분의 개인정보 및 응답하신 내용에 관한 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">모든 정보</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">는 개인정보보호법, 통계법 등에 의해 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">철저히 보호</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">됩니다.</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 80%; TEXT-INDENT: -13pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 13pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 80%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -46.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 46.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 조사시스템 접속은 본인 고유의 이메일을 통해서만 가능하고, </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">응답내용</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">은 E-mail주소, IP주소 등과 함께 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">암호화</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">되어 기관 외부의 별도 시스템에 저장됩니다.</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 50%; TEXT-INDENT: -47.9pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 47.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 50%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -47.9pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 47.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">자료처리 및 집계과정에서도 모든 정보는 코드화되어 처리되므로 안</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">심하시고 조사에 참여해주시기 바랍니다.</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; TEXT-INDENT: -13pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 13pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -13pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 13pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;여러분의 솔직한 응답은 공직사회 전반에 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">청렴문화를 정착시키는데 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">기</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">여</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">할 것입니다. 바쁘시더라도 정해진 기간 내에 솔직하고 성실한 답변을</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> 부탁드립니다.</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; TEXT-INDENT: -6.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 6.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -6.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 6.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;한편, 귀 기관에서 내부청렴도 응답자 현황을 파악하거나 회의,교육 등을</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> 통해 호의적 응답을 유도하는 등 청렴도 측정의 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">신뢰도를 저해하는 행위</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">가 발생했다고 판단되실 경우에는 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">아래로 제보</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 50%; TEXT-INDENT: -6.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 6.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 50%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -6.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 6.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 국민권익위원회 청렴조사평가과</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -6.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 6.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMIL